---
title: role.nekomata.curse-immediately=true (default) で処刑時の道連れが即時 curse_kill
setup: { nekomata: 1, werewolf: 1, werehamster: 1, villager: 1 }
rules:
  role.nekomata.curse-immediately: true
  role.nekomata.curse-target: villager
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Day 2 で Alice (猫又) 処刑 → curse-target=villager で Dave 確定、 即時 curse_kill 発火。
# Dave 死因 = curse_kill。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=猫又
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=妖狐
!Dave=村人

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Alice
Bob→Alice
Carol→Alice
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# Alice execution → curse_kill Dave (即時)
# == end ==

# @expect-status Dave: dead
# @expect-cause Dave: curse_kill
